The 2026-10-02 OPDS loading and webtoon display changes for version 0.4.11
use KOReader's connectivity gate and retain bounded catalog failure categories.
Optional webtoon display composes a bounded screen across adjacent images,
stores a normalized local reading anchor, and retires incompatible display
sessions and stale requests. It was independently implemented from observed
behavior; no source from smart-webtoon-scroll.koplugin was incorporated.
Native decoder peak memory and live-server/display behavior remain subject
to device validation. Reference revisions are recorded in docs/verification.md
in the source repository.
